    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help <strong>Pedro Ricardo Jr.</strong> to have his work card signed. That's right, you didn't get it wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Spooky Workers</strong> is a 2D indie puzzle-platform game that tells the story of Pedro, a scared young man who got an internship at Madama Bruna's House of Horrors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you know the difficult life of an intern? No? So get ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wear a dinosaur head (that you made yourself) and scare all the customers to get the boss's attention. Think it's simple? Telma from Human Resources will demand a lot from you and demand a senior job (even though you earn a pittance). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the 40 phases by balancing the <strong>IDEAL TIME</strong>, collecting <strong>ALL THE ITEMS</strong> and scaring <strong>ALL THE CUSTOMERS</strong> (phew... I'm tired) to finally win the title of employee of the month and have your work card signed + benefits. It's every <span class=\"bb_strike\">player's</span> Pedro's dream, ,right?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help <strong>Pedro Ricardo Jr.</strong> to have his work card signed. That's right, you didn't get it wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Spooky Workers</strong> is a 2D indie puzzle-platform game that tells the story of Pedro, a scared young man who got an internship at Madama Bruna's House of Horrors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you know the difficult life of an intern? No? So get ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wear a dinosaur head (that you made yourself) and scare all the customers to get the boss's attention. Think it's simple? Telma from Human Resources will demand a lot from you and demand a senior job (even though you earn a pittance). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the 40 phases by balancing the <strong>IDEAL TIME</strong>, collecting <strong>ALL THE ITEMS</strong> and scaring <strong>ALL THE CUSTOMERS</strong> (phew... I'm tired) to finally win the title of employee of the month and have your work card signed + benefits. It's every <span class=\"bb_strike\">player's</span> Pedro's dream, ,right?</p>",
    "short_description": "Help Pedro Ricardo Jr. to scare all the customers at Madama Bruna's House of Horrors to stop being an intern and get your work card signed. Spooky Workers is an indie 2D puzzle/platform game that will surprise you.",
